  "notes": [
    "The traditional Mongolian script (Uyghur-Mongolian, as used in Inner Mongolia) for SquirrelGo Alphabets. The script is written in vertical columns; the app shows it upright. Example IPA is the modern spoken form, which is often shorter than the spelling. eSpeak NG has no Mongolian voice, so sounds are recorded from the IPA. Hints, groupings and articles are original."
